("b07", "hours", "Airframe time is five thousand, five hundred hours. The typical one seventy-two N on the market has about seventy-five hundred. So this airframe is roughly two thousand hours younger than its peers. The engine is the other story. Fifteen hundred hours since major overhaul, on an engine with a two-thousand-hour time between overhauls. Three quarters of the way through its life. Hold that thought."),
